  nameColor: {r: 0.7, g: 0.3, b: 0.3, a: 1}
  firstMeeting:
  - Good day. Dr. Grace Abara. I lecture in history at the university in the city, four days a week.
  - And you are the new farmer. 'Farmer' comes from an old word for rent, did you know? No? You do now.
  chatLines:
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - The city is forty minutes of walking and one very long road. I mark essays in my head on the way.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Emeka knows everyone's business and tells nobody. It is the most admirable thing about him.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - A student wrote 'the olden days' in an essay this week. I had to sit down.
  - label: Lecture days
    priority: 12
    conditions:
      days: 15
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - I really must be going. Forty students are waiting to be disappointed by their grades.
  - label: Rain
    priority: 10
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 28
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Rain. Excellent marking weather. Dreadful walking weather.
