  nameColor: {r: 0.45, g: 0.35, b: 0.6, a: 1}
  firstMeeting:
  - Hey, hey. Tariq. I'm the reason this street has a soundtrack.
  - I play in the plaza most afternoons and in the city on weekends. Requests are free. Taste is extra.
