    pages:
    - I moved here for the quiet. Then I found out I can't write when it's quiet.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Somebody leaves soup on my step every week. I've never caught them. I wash the bowl and it vanishes.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - The playground bench is the best seat in town. Everyone tells stories near a playground. I just... borrow them.
  - label: Rain
