  - {fileID: -1389587518, guid: b46bfa17b904bea429603312110bfe36, type: 3}
  side:
  - {fileID: -608056183, guid: b46bfa17b904bea429603312110bfe36, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -724871922, guid: b46bfa17b904bea429603312110bfe36, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 807315876, guid: b46bfa17b904bea429603312110bfe36, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -604994622, guid: b46bfa17b904bea429603312110bfe36, type: 3}
  portraitIdle: {fileID: 1301282297, guid: 4cc8e55484542ec4e892cda36ffda944, type: 3}
  portraitTalk: {fileID: -1583319146, guid: 4cc8e55484542ec4e892cda36ffda944, type: 3}
  portraitHappy: {fileID: 979577462, guid: 4cc8e55484542ec4e892cda36ffda944, type: 3}
  portraitBlink: {fileID: -552503301, guid: 4cc8e55484542ec4e892cda36ffda944, type: 3}
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 031b059d99820c5458641095e4070c10, type: 3}
  portraitFrame: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 596599fae9cbc8c4386d6ff2e60a29f2, type: 3}
  nameColor: {r: 0.5, g: 0.4, b: 0.65, a: 1}
  firstMeeting:
  - Well, hello, petal. Ada Kowalczyk. I had the flower stall in the city for thirty years. Now I just do the plaza planters, for love.
  - Never water after sunset, never cut on a Friday, and never, ever tell a rose it looks tired.
  chatLines:
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - The red tulips by the general store are sulking. Somebody's been sitting on the planter. I have my suspicions.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - My cat, Pan Tadeusz, doesn't go outside. He thinks outside is a rumour, same as that Tariq and mornings.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Bea and I meet at the seed rack on Tuesdays. Lovely girl. Reads the back of every packet out loud.
  - label: Rain
    priority: 10
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 28
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Rain on a Wednesday means a good week for sweet peas. My mother always said so.
  - label: Spring
    priority: 8
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 1
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Spring! I've been awake since five. So have the daffodils. We don't like to waste it.
  shop: {fileID: 0}
  hardware: {fileID: 0}
  shopSpotId: StoreCheckout
  shopSpotRadius: 3
  nowDoing: 
