  portraitIdle: {fileID: 1710974087, guid: 811c54c84c5adc04daedec20fd453b0a, type: 3}
  portraitTalk: {fileID: -1070933108, guid: 811c54c84c5adc04daedec20fd453b0a, type: 3}
  portraitHappy: {fileID: 347325719, guid: 811c54c84c5adc04daedec20fd453b0a, type: 3}
  portraitBlink: {fileID: 539803393, guid: 811c54c84c5adc04daedec20fd453b0a, type: 3}
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 031b059d99820c5458641095e4070c10, type: 3}
  portraitFrame: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 596599fae9cbc8c4386d6ff2e60a29f2, type: 3}
  nameColor: {r: 0.85, g: 0.45, b: 0.1, a: 1}
  firstMeeting:
  - Well, hello there! Name's Frank. Frank's Home and Hardware. Yes, that's the sign, yes, I put it up myself.
  - Floors, walls, windows, doors, cabinets, stoves. If your house needs it, I've got it. Or I'll order it.
  - Walk around, look at everything, and holler if you want a hand.
  chatLines:
  - label: Default
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Need a hand with the house?
  - label: Default 2
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Measure twice, cut once. Then come back and buy another board anyway. Everybody does.
  - label: Default 3
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - That big tower in the city sells doors in a box. A door! In a box! You come to Frank for a real door.
  - label: Default 4
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Gus from next door says my prices are robbery. Gus has been 'just looking' for eleven years.
  - label: Rain
    priority: 10
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 12
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Good weather for staying in and fixing up the house, if you ask me.
  - label: Snow
    priority: 10
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 16
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Snow's coming down. Best time to think about insulation. And windows. Mostly windows.
  - label: Sunday
    priority: 12
    conditions:
      days: 64
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Sundays I put my feet up. Don't tell anyone I answered the door.
  - label: A few upgrades
    priority: 20
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters:
      - key: house_upgrades
        atLeast: 3
        atMost: -1
    pages:
    - I hear your house is looking sharp. That's my doing, you know. Mostly.
  - label: Lots of upgrades
    priority: 30
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters:
      - key: house_upgrades
        atLeast: 12
        atMost: -1
    pages:
    - Twelve upgrades! I'm going to need to hire somebody just to carry your orders.
  shop: {fileID: 0}
  hardware: {fileID: 1692541251}
  shopSpotId: HwCounter
  shopSpotRadius: 3.5
  nowDoing: 
