  nameColor: {r: 0.25, g: 0.6, b: 0.58, a: 1}
  firstMeeting:
  - Hi. Priya Nair. Sorry, I've been awake since four. I'm a nurse at the hospital in the city.
  - If you cut yourself on a scythe, come to me before you go to Frank for duct tape.
  chatLines:
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Four early shifts a week. On my days off I do something wild, like sit down.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Dev eats like a horse and trains like one. I'd complain, but he does the dishes.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - People think nurses want chocolates. We want shoes that don't hurt.
  - label: Shift days
    priority: 12
    conditions:
      days: 27
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Early shift today. If I look asleep, I am. Keep talking, it's fine.
  - label: Rain
    priority: 10
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 28
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Rainy days mean slips and sprains. Watch your step out there, please.
