  portraitIdle: {fileID: 1907830765, guid: b93def7f3cc5da14fb348b4a630e3600, type: 3}
  portraitTalk: {fileID: 2003993024, guid: b93def7f3cc5da14fb348b4a630e3600, type: 3}
  portraitHappy: {fileID: 1422646232, guid: b93def7f3cc5da14fb348b4a630e3600, type: 3}
  portraitBlink: {fileID: 1767290852, guid: b93def7f3cc5da14fb348b4a630e3600, type: 3}
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 031b059d99820c5458641095e4070c10, type: 3}
  portraitFrame: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 596599fae9cbc8c4386d6ff2e60a29f2, type: 3}
  nameColor: {r: 0.85, g: 0.55, b: 0.15, a: 1}
  firstMeeting:
  - Hi! Lucia Reyes! I work at city hall in the mornings and coach the kids' football in the afternoons.
  - You look strong. Farm strong. Ever played left back?
  chatLines:
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Dev has the best left foot I've coached. If he finds out I said that, he'll stop running laps.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - City hall is forms, stamps and waiting. Coaching is shouting and oranges. Guess which one I'd do for free.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - My brother talks to the grass. The grass is immaculate, so I've stopped teasing him. Mostly.
  - label: Rain
    priority: 10
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 28
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - No practice in the rain! Mateo's rule. The pitch outranks the coach around here.
  - label: City hall days
    priority: 8
    conditions:
      days: 15
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - City hall this morning. If you ever need a permit, bring a sandwich. And a book.
