  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 031b059d99820c5458641095e4070c10, type: 3}
  portraitFrame: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 596599fae9cbc8c4386d6ff2e60a29f2, type: 3}
  nameColor: {r: 0.3, g: 0.35, b: 0.55, a: 1}
  firstMeeting:
  - How do you do. Yuki Tanaka. I am a curator at the museum in the city.
  - Your farm is older than this whole suburb, you know. If you dig up anything interesting, I would love to see it first.
  chatLines:
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - The museum is closed on Mondays. So on Mondays, I visit other people's shops and judge their displays.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - My father does tai chi at dawn and wins at chess by nine. Retirement suits him far too well.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Frank's sign is crooked by two degrees. I have not said anything. It is very hard.
  - label: Work days
    priority: 8
    conditions:
      days: 62
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
