  nameColor: {r: 0.25, g: 0.35, b: 0.55, a: 1}
  firstMeeting:
  - Welcome, welcome! I'm Jae-hoon. My wife and I run this shop.
  - Seeds, snacks, slush - if we don't have it, tell me and I'll order it.
  chatLines:
  - label: Default
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Good to see you again! Fresh stock came in this week.
  - label: Default 2
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Thirty years behind this till. I know what every house on the street eats for breakfast.
  - label: Default 3
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - That tower in the city sells everything cheaper. But they don't know your name, do they?
  - label: Rain
    priority: 10
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 12
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Terrible weather, isn't it? Good for the crops, at least.
  - label: Sunday
    priority: 12
    conditions:
      days: 64
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Sunday is my wholesale day. The city is loud, but the prices are good.
  - label: Snow
    priority: 10
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 16
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Snow already! Bundle up out there.
  - label: Winter
    priority: 8
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 8
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Winter is slow for the shop. Warm slush sells surprisingly well, though.
  - label: Forest grove
    priority: 20
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags:
      - forest_grove_reached
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - I heard you found something strange in the forest. Be careful in there.
