  portraitIdle: {fileID: 990885354, guid: 59299d39846ba4f4fa220764f7c1619c, type: 3}
  portraitTalk: {fileID: 1896009703, guid: 59299d39846ba4f4fa220764f7c1619c, type: 3}
  portraitHappy: {fileID: 580477291, guid: 59299d39846ba4f4fa220764f7c1619c, type: 3}
  portraitBlink: {fileID: -1552067596, guid: 59299d39846ba4f4fa220764f7c1619c, type: 3}
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 031b059d99820c5458641095e4070c10, type: 3}
  portraitFrame: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 596599fae9cbc8c4386d6ff2e60a29f2, type: 3}
  nameColor: {r: 0.75, g: 0.35, b: 0.5, a: 1}
  firstMeeting:
  - Oh, hello, dear! Rosa Delgado. You've met Walt? Don't mind him, he growls at everyone he likes.
  - Do you eat bread? Of course you eat bread. I'll bring you a loaf.
  chatLines:
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - I bake at six, the Kims have my bread by nine, and it's gone by ten. Mi-sook pays me in kimchi.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - The pigeons in the plaza know my footsteps. Walt says that's nothing to be proud of.
  - label: Any time
    priority: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - That young Sam on Maple Lane never eats properly. I leave soup on the step. The bowl always comes back washed.
  - label: Rain
    priority: 10
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 28
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - A wet day is a soup day, dear. Remember that and you'll never be sad.
  - label: Winter
    priority: 8
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 8
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - I knit one scarf for every house on the street each winter. Yours is green.
  shop: {fileID: 0}
  hardware: {fileID: 0}
  shopSpotId: StoreCheckout
  shopSpotRadius: 3
  nowDoing: 
